[
  {"comment": "Thread end chamfers (mitcad#304). An M8 bolt: an 8 mm shank 16 long (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2) under a 14 mm head 5 thick (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4) joined to it."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 8},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 16}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F3", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 14},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 16}, "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 5},
    "operation": "join", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1573.9379194, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "A modelled M8 (basic profile) chamfered at both ends: only the free end at the tip gets the cone, of the default diameter (the minor diameter less P/10) at 45 degrees (Thread1 F5). The volume is the exact one of test_end_chamfers in geometry/tests/test_thread.cpp, as is the tapped hole's below."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6g"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "both"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1429.2123228717446, "tolerance": 2e-5, "min_face_area": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F5:thread(F2:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "The face's cylinder runs from the head to the tip: the tip is its high end."},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F5:thread_chamfer_high(F2:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "The threads query lists it from the head to where the cone meets the crest, 4 - r = 0.7390825 above the tip (r = 3.2609175, the default diameter's radius): the crest lies on the face, whose pieces stay."},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F2:side(c1)"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F5", "face": "F2:side(c1)", "modeled": true,
    "major_diameter": 8, "minor_diameter": 6.6468352370489596, "radius": 4, "start": [0, 0, 16], "end": [0, 0, 0.7390823814755202]}]}},
  {"comment": "With a radial clearance the crest (7.8) lies inside the face, and no piece of the face is left (mitcad#433): the thread is listed on the face as it was before the feature, again to the cone's inner edge. The default diameter follows the root (6.6468352 - 0.2 - 0.125), so the cone is as deep: (7.8 - 6.3218352) / 2."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6g"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "both", "radial_clearance": 0.1}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F5:thread_chamfer_high(F2:side(c1))"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F5", "face": "F2:side(c1)", "modeled": true,
    "major_diameter": 8, "minor_diameter": 6.6468352370489596, "radius": 4, "start": [0, 0, 16], "end": [0, 0, 0.7390823814755202]}]}},

  {"comment": "The fine size M8x1: the chamfer left at its default follows the size (its minor diameter less P/10)."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8x1", "class": "6g"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "both"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1456.8017536333555, "tolerance": 2e-5, "min_face_area": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F5:thread_chamfer_high(F2:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "The same as that default given (M8x1: 8 - 1.25 H - 0.1 = 6.817468 mm), and only at the start (the high end, where location measures from)."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8x1", "class": "6g"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "start",
    "chamfer_diameter": 6.8174682452694516, "chamfer_angle": "45 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1456.8017536333555, "tolerance": 2e-5}},
  {"comment": "Only at the end (the low end, at the head, which is not free): no chamfer."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8x1", "class": "6g"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "end"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1458.2559708000877, "tolerance": 2e-5}},

  {"comment": "Cosmetic M8 chamfered at both ends: the cone at the tip only, 45 degrees from the default diameter 6.521835: pi (49 5 + 16 16) - 2 pi (64/3 - 8 r + r^3/6), r = 3.2609175."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6g"}, "chamfer": "both"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1567.4964039089436, "tolerance": 1e-6, "min_face_area": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F5:thread_chamfer_high(F2:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "Its rings start where the cone meets the cylinder, 4 - r = 0.7390825 above the tip."},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F5", "modeled": false, "start": [0, 0, 16], "end": [0, 0, 0.7390823814755202]}]}},

  {"comment": "Cosmetic, 10 long from the tip with its start chamfered: the rings still end 10 from the tip, and start at the cone."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6g"}, "chamfer": "start", "length": 10}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 1567.4964039089436, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "threads"}, "result": [{"feature": "F5", "start": [0, 0, 10], "end": [0, 0, 0.7390823814755202]}]}},

  {"comment": "A tapped M8 hole: a 30 x 30 x 12 block (Sketch3 F6, Extrude3 F7) bored through at the basic minor diameter 6.646835 (Sketch4 F8, Extrude4 F9), threaded M8 6H modelled with both mouths countersunk to the default diameter (the major one plus P/10, 8.125) at 45 degrees, a 90-degree countersink (Thread2 F10)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F6", "corner": [85, -15], "width": 30, "height": 30},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F6", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 12}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F8", "center": [100, 0], "diameter": 6.6468352370489596},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F8", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F7.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F7.b0", "face": "F9:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6H"}, "modeled": true, "chamfer": "both"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread2", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "volume": 10297.726186403117, "tolerance": 2e-5, "min_face_area": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F10:thread_chamfer_low(F9:side(c1))"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "has_face": "F10:thread_chamfer_high(F9:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "Cosmetic: the two countersinks alone, 10800 - 12 pi a^2 - 4 pi (R^3/6 - R a^2/2 + a^3/3), a = 3.3234176 (the bore), R = 4.0625."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F10", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F7.b0", "face": "F9:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6H"}, "chamfer": "both"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F7.b0", "volume": 10371.357368401303, "tolerance": 1e-6, "min_face_area": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F10:thread_chamfer_low(F9:side(c1))"}},
  {"comment": "A countersink no wider than the bore cuts nothing: the feature fails."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F10", "def": {"type": "thread", "faces": [{"body": "F7.b0", "face": "F9:side(c1)"}],
    "thread": {"designation": "M8", "class": "6H"}, "chamfer": "both", "chamfer_diameter": 6}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Thread2", "status": "error", "error_contains": "must be larger than"}}
]
